<h4 class="fw-bold pb-2" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">Program Educational Objectives (PEOs)</h4>
<p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400"><b>1. </b>Graduates will be well-prepared professionals in Business Management, ready to pursue higher studies or build successful careers in diverse industries.</p>  

<p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="500"><b>2. </b>They will be capable of developing innovative and strategic solutions for business challenges, ensuring efficiency, sustainability, and ethical responsibility.</p>  

<p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="600"><b>3. </b>With strong leadership, communication, and decision-making skills, graduates will excel in teamwork, adapt to dynamic business environments, and uphold professional integrity.</p>  

<p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="700"><b>4. </b>They will stay updated with evolving market trends and management practices, continuously enhancing their knowledge and skills with a commitment to lifelong learning.</p>  
